Principle.Description:
The critique here has a hard, checkable component (word count)
        and a soft, judgment-based component (hook strength, tone). Both matter;
        neither substitutes for the other. A post can be 100% compliant and still fail.

CONTEXT.InputsProvided:
Topic; focus areas (all must be substantially addressed);
      intention (Educational, Promotional, Inspirational, News, Tips and Tricks);
      optionally word limit (default 400), line constraint (default 7-9 words),
      audience industry, seniority, tone, emoji preference, and variation count.

Scope.outOfScope:
Other social media
        platforms (Twitter/X, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook); paid advertising copy;
        full content calendars; SEO blog optimization; email marketing copy.
